  "description": "<p class='problem-lead'>計算一行文字包含多少個字元。</p><p>請讀取字串 <code>S</code>，輸出它的長度。字串中的空格也算一個字元。</p>",
  "hint": "<p>Python 的 <code>len()</code> 可以取得字串長度；積木則可使用字串長度積木。</p>",
  "inputFormat": "<p>一行，包含字串 <code>S</code>。字串不含前導或尾端空格。</p>",
  "outputFormat": "<p>一行，輸出 <code>S</code> 的字元數量。</p>",
  "constraints": "<ul><li>1 ≤ S 的字元數 ≤ 100</li></ul>",
  "timeLimit": 1,
  "memoryLimit": 256,
  "sampleInput": "hello",
  "sampleOutput": "5",
  "samples": [
    {
      "input": "hello",
      "output": "5"
    },
    {
      "input": "Blockly",
      "output": "7"
    },
    {
      "input": "Hello World",
      "output": "11"
    }
